          "date": "2026-09-10 17:50:56.000000000",
          "tz": 120
        },
        "subject": "LU-10026 ofd: properly locate root object",
        "message": "LU-10026 ofd: properly locate root object\n\nofd_init0() gets root object by using dt_locate_at() with\nan OSD device as top. As result lu_object can be incomplete\nif it doesn't exist yet. Instead dt_locate() should be used.\n\nPatch fixes that and adds error handling in related places.\nWhen the compr_stats file cannot be obtained the reference is\ncleared, so that it is neither saved nor released at fini.\n\nTest-Parameters: forjanitoronly\nDDN-bug-id: EX-13567\nSigned-off-by: Mikhail Pershin <mpershin@whamcloud.com>\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I9f5eaaae9c4ea23225f574b8e7cde64b3c5f47b6\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
